WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:20.475
"We love skidding!" said Poppy.

2
00:00:20.476 --> 00:00:25.713
"Our tires are fine!" said Dipper.

3
00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:48.088
Eddy's friends kept skidding.

4
00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:53.553
"That does look like fun," Eddy thought.

5
00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:59.557
"But I'll just watch."

6
00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:05.238
More cars and trucks came over.

7
00:01:05.239 --> 00:01:08.764
"Watch me skid!" yelled a van.

8
00:01:08.765 --> 00:01:10.660
Vroom!

9
00:01:10.661 --> 00:01:13.402
The van made a sharp turn.

10
00:01:13.403 --> 00:01:16.708
She slammed on her brakes.

11
00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:24.812
The van skidded sideways!

12
00:01:24.813 --> 00:01:28.958
"Watch this!" cried a jeep.

13
00:01:28.959 --> 00:01:34.424
He zoomed through the construction site.

14
00:01:34.425 --> 00:01:39.563
The jeep went up the dirt hill.

15
00:01:39.564 --> 00:01:42.914
He flew through the air.

16
00:01:42.915 --> 00:01:47.597
Then he skidded through the dirt.

17
00:01:47.598 --> 00:01:51.931
Everyone cheered.

18
00:01:51.932 --> 00:01:54.842
Eddy sighed.

19
00:01:54.843 --> 00:01:58.875
"Everyone is having fun," he thought.

20
00:01:58.876 --> 00:02:07.943
"But skidding is bad for tires."
